    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74f9c8e5f006240199f0ad14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是……罗布罗伊的……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a998caaeae20e38fb8e50393fba8fb98aa5d874bbe979e9a7bf3e9ecabf17250",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15dd7a44f29ff70fbb15990",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这姑娘一下子就跑没影儿了……\r\n正当我也准备离开时，却看见椅子上正摆着本似曾相识的\r\n笔记本。",
      "source_fingerprint": "677b00b01ec5e30ad1d76915979a6b2fb6e3d9bf78273e6fded989a1d6d92d26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:939f7a8f145ae8612007c4c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来她走得太过慌张，不小心把这东西落下了……\r\n即便如此，仍不能确定这就是她的东西。为了确认失主，\r\n我打开这本笔记——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7460d6b7b12eea308b5bf792622e43798f2527570724da0716559f3fa7b5ec06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60c5f85c867350bad3a4d01d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "笔记本被写得密密麻麻。上面记载的，\r\n全是今天旁观吉兆训练时的心得体会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d161e6519c79879ac15c76edb39ed827168e786c674fe6da5612ae867912a36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22787d117c44168f5bf6a83c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很温柔的教官",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aec3630ad85848311010380037039b2f595cd6bc9a2a2b471c0ceebd0f99d44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c83f3cfb64acc380993b3b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "您好，打扰一下！\r\n那个，请问您是不是罗布罗伊同学的——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e38acff5ac3fdf2ea6197ceed94343c66b4b272d7177ed895147b2ad0dddd811",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be2fd139cd0d36eece608641",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以我也一直没找到……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e09ddaf87589374c914c88a25fae8a0cfe397ebea785dcacaf8c37708c7d0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
