    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71945a259d8cd1cf1effc2e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这段时间里有太多赛马娘出入训练场，\r\n实在是难以根据记录来看出是哪位在那时使用跑道……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aaaf11c69d45cd1a08252ab8e89447c627b1e9dadc123e2c4eafd7f06848974",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:056f59567dc320139067de17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知不觉间，我已经彻底沉迷于这笔记之中。\r\n没想到她平日里那副老实怕生的外表之下，\r\n竟隐藏着如此炽热的激情……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c395427c9ee3f7f2e86a92f2ac6a8327d7400004892a7edb6be8039cf8674a0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:745c6467f9fbe26d8119c62a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哇？！不、不好意思！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ea2a7de64b8702f076eecc631dcd8405189f2004fd55e731c451a8d3912c8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
