    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c6fc874fb71fc84cdb33fc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没有没有！那个，您刚刚是和罗布罗伊同学在一起对吧？\r\n难不成，您是她的签约训练员吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "98b0d4086b5e3192ff85073d09c250f25b3158b32efe8898b3add141b53cee8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a932dd70087ec0304bcc1052",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说起来，我还没和罗布罗伊谈过签约的事情来着。\r\n我和她完全沉迷于调查英雄，完全没想起别的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26388d91149d86dda2de3ea1f75b80a966dcafec48447dcee1800351e2d9c63e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc6f5bf7d0eab201b95f1018",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很温柔的教官",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aec3630ad85848311010380037039b2f595cd6bc9a2a2b471c0ceebd0f99d44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
