      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个孩子受过伤，已经错过好几场选拔赛了……\r\n自那以后，她就一直没什么精神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bb53a193239213b39f0f702b861a77198c9fd7b20b523370da77b7edb071226",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
