    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377cace2d47e56435d1620c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最近正好有分类别竞技大会，我也告诉过她要是能好好表\r\n现的话，说不定能给训练员们留下个好印象——",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ecd6499931bd9adb460bcefdc3f836c525893efdf4af6a3cebc97e57dd27db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
