    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aa037ad29b3e3f4e65371a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——但最近，她连自主训练的时间都减少了。\r\n我有些担心她是不是已经丧失斗志了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "32481bf6efebb7d495dbcbe1c9e09c6640c51bbd62ac72d9b460376cccc2b0f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
