      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:515e60fd430e15ece18087b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……所以刚刚在看见她喊您『训练员』的时候，\r\n我自顾自地高兴了好久……\r\n实在是抱歉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb816dd0d0fc89fd17c41f34881bdf168d765e3b5f98fad18f7cd6084ebf5afa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbc8e630f48dcf348127ac47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我想，应该没关系的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1de1adc6d3dd918e40e2baaf28e4ff507db00970d81c3915d3d39da33e8ad83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65d7f1f47e374a65dc04d3bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "教官深深鞠躬，向我道歉。\r\n她最近自主训练的时间减少，\r\n大概就是因为在忙『追寻英雄之旅』了吧。不过——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4c0b301a992f4ea265619090f97a04e3c99918c3990a37a3bccf603cc891ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89b092b9c683b03ce2d58888",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很温柔的教官",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aec3630ad85848311010380037039b2f595cd6bc9a2a2b471c0ceebd0f99d44",
