      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44c481c36b5bebb7a57a5260",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我认为……她是不会不战而逃的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd2f95b267695ca80211a56b314ebc858ecf4f4d4ca72f3ba93523831ae1c46b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c17900bf2eed7acd53ae6204",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说她因忙着与我一同进行『追寻英雄之旅』而减少了自主\r\n训练的时间，但那一定也有她的理由才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41afd82de6d225075b1ac837c65b366cd2e742b85a63d2c1e6886f5e81cdb19c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e374daa32a1d68eb2d9b17cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为——她不小心丢掉的那本笔记中的每一个字，\r\n都透出了她『想要变得更强』的信念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "736b1f5714b2e32080666c149cdb16fd7e3d45ec08a292052606fd2beb18e910",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0cbb8dc5f12e460e11a60fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
