      "uid": "zhcn:14016c942ae9ac7ed1bc7da7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然做的事情都让人感觉『好奇妙呀』，\r\n但实际上脑子特～别聪明的赛马娘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3e32d45fe346ed68a0ccec408816ae3fd7b67bcb84d573207d8d6c2a591d80d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
